  <!-- EN: Portugal -->
  <BA_Portugal_NobleHouse.label>葡萄牙</BA_Portugal_NobleHouse.label>
  <!-- EN: Of all of the European royal courts, Portugal is the youngest, having only just recently come of age, growing from county to Kingdom. As is typical at this stage of life, there have been more than a few growing pains for Portugal, and its inaugural King, Afonso Henrique. As if being recognised as the sovereign of a land were not hard enough at the best of times, Afonso's own mother attempted to seize power for herself before he was forced to defeat and then exile her!\n\n<i><color=#66E0E4FF>Medieval Kingdoms: Iberia</color></i> -->
  <BA_Portugal_NobleHouse.description>在欧洲所有王室中，葡萄牙最为年轻，刚刚步入成熟阶段，从伯国发展为王国。正如这一阶段的常见情况，葡萄牙及其开国国王阿方索·恩里克斯经历了不少成长的烦恼。即便在最顺利的时期，要被认可为一片土地的君主已非易事，而阿方索甚至被迫击败并流放了试图夺权的亲生母亲！</BA_Portugal_NobleHouse.description>
